-- title:
--   Round six, complex side: cost bound O(V e^σ) for histogram networks
-- statement:
--   Let $J$ be a round-six complex network with child-width histogram $h$, $m \ge 2$, $0 < \sigma \le 1$, $L_{\mathrm{loc}} \ge 0$, all widths in $(0, m)$, and suppose `histMoment h m σ < W`. Then there is $K$ such that for all $e$ and $V \ge 0$
--
--   $$\mathrm{recCostH}(J, L_{\mathrm{loc}}, e, V) \le K\, V\, e^{\sigma}.$$
--
--   In Lean:
